    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Xeno Wild is a multiplayer survival experience that challenges players to adapt and thrive in a Alien environment space full of dangers. In this vast and immersive world, you can take control of different creatures, from majestic dinosaurs to fearsome predators. Each choice brings its own advantages and challenges as you strive to survive in a dynamic and unforgiving ecosystem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Life Cycle and Survival Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main gameplay mode in Lost Island is the <strong>Life Cycle</strong>, where you begin your journey as a juvenile creature. In this mode, every decision is crucial for your survival. You will face a series of challenges, from finding food and shelter to avoiding predators and dealing with threatening environmental events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you grow and evolve, you can unlock new skills and talents that enhance your abilities, allowing you to become a stronger and more adaptable creature. Growth is not just a matter of time; it\u2019s a constant struggle for survival where learning and adaptation are essential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hostile environment and interaction with other players add complexity, as you may form alliances or become rivals with other beings sharing the island. Nature is both your ally and your enemy, and exploring the island's diverse biomes will reveal secrets that can be crucial for your evolution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Living and Changing Ecosystem</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Xeno Wild, the environment is not just a backdrop but an active character that influences gameplay. Challenges include predators, natural disasters, and the ongoing fight for survival. Cooperation among players can be vital to uncover the mysteries of the island and endure the forces of nature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to test your limits in Lost Island, where only the most cunning and adaptable will survive and thrive!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Xeno Wild is a multiplayer survival experience that challenges players to adapt and thrive in a Alien environment space full of dangers. In this vast and immersive world, you can take control of different creatures, from majestic dinosaurs to fearsome predators. Each choice brings its own advantages and challenges as you strive to survive in a dynamic and unforgiving ecosystem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Life Cycle and Survival Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main gameplay mode in Lost Island is the <strong>Life Cycle</strong>, where you begin your journey as a juvenile creature. In this mode, every decision is crucial for your survival. You will face a series of challenges, from finding food and shelter to avoiding predators and dealing with threatening environmental events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you grow and evolve, you can unlock new skills and talents that enhance your abilities, allowing you to become a stronger and more adaptable creature. Growth is not just a matter of time; it\u2019s a constant struggle for survival where learning and adaptation are essential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hostile environment and interaction with other players add complexity, as you may form alliances or become rivals with other beings sharing the island. Nature is both your ally and your enemy, and exploring the island's diverse biomes will reveal secrets that can be crucial for your evolution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Living and Changing Ecosystem</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Xeno Wild, the environment is not just a backdrop but an active character that influences gameplay. Challenges include predators, natural disasters, and the ongoing fight for survival. Cooperation among players can be vital to uncover the mysteries of the island and endure the forces of nature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to test your limits in Lost Island, where only the most cunning and adaptable will survive and thrive!</p>",
